1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
There is love. Love and presence exist, but

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,860
love changes temperature without warning.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:10,580
And this child develops anxiety she cannot control,

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:13,008
because she never knows what will happen,

5
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:15,227
whether she will receive love or whether her

6
00:00:15,227 --> 00:00:16,740
parents will be distant today.

7
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:20,703
Inside, unable to understand adult life, she

8
00:00:20,703 --> 00:00:22,820
thinks she is the problem.

9
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,930
She thinks she did something wrong and that

10
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:29,360
something she does can make her stop being loved,

11
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,871
as if there were danger: the danger of

12
00:00:31,871 --> 00:00:33,480
abandonment, the danger of pain.

13
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:37,196
This sets off responses in the nervous system

14
00:00:37,196 --> 00:00:39,220
that we carry into adult life.

15
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,024
This danger alarm is built there, without you

16
00:00:43,024 --> 00:00:47,160
knowing, and keeps being triggered by the same feelings.

17
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:52,120
You take this into your relationship and your friendships,

18
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,362
where you feel rejected, as though people

19
00:00:54,362 --> 00:00:55,500
always leave you out.

20
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,082
You take it into your workplace, with the

21
00:00:58,082 --> 00:00:59,720
feeling that someone there

22
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:03,357
must be saying something bad about you or is

23
00:01:03,357 --> 00:01:04,720
not happy with you.

24
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,840
You keep feeling at risk of being fired, for example,

25
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:11,522
or being abandoned, with that feeling that

26
00:01:11,522 --> 00:01:14,220
whatever you do is never enough.

27
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:17,720
And that is exactly how your inner child felt.

